<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, I turn my heart to Thee.</l><l>Take my veils away,</l><l>Purify my heart to see</l><l>Thee through all my days.</l><l>Lord, I give my heart to Thee.</l><l>How I love Thee so!</l><l>Make Thy home in all my heart,</l><l>Through my being flow.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I, my spirit exercise,</l><l>Nothing outwardly.</l><l>By my spirit’s function—three—</l><l>I may contact Thee.</l><l>Touch my conscience thoroughly.</l><l>I, my sins confess.</l><l>Enter into fellowship,</l><l>Oneness with Thee sense.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Living God, I come to Thee.</l><l>From dead works save me.</l><l>Purify my conscience, Lord,</l><l>That I might serve Thee.</l><l>Daily, I now exercise</l><l>All sins to confess.</l><l>That my conscience clear may be,</l><l>Void of all offense.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
